name: sim.getSignalName
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: string signalName = sim.getSignalName(int signalIndex, int signalType)
pythonSynopsis: string signalName = sim.getSignalName(int signalIndex, int signalType)
inputs:
1. signalIndex: zero based index
2. signalType: signal type:
    - 0: integer signals
    - 2: string signals
    - 3: float signals
outputs:
1. signalName: name of the signal at the given index
